        "Presence of other metabolic abnormalities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "pyridoxine-dependent-epilepsy",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Seizures responsive to pyridoxine rather than folinic acid",
        "Different genetic mutations (ALDH7A1)",
        "Distinct biochemical markers"
      ]
    }
  ],
